[LINK: (1949) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1949]  –  [LINK: (These Are My Children) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/These_Are_My_Children] , the first television daytime  [LINK: (soap opera) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soap_opera] , is broadcast by the NBC station in Chicago, United States.

[LINK: (1951) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1951]  –  [LINK: (United Nations Security Council Resolution 90) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations_Security_Council_Resolution_90]  relating to the  [LINK: (Korean War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korean_War]  is adopted.

[LINK: (1953) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1953]  – A  [LINK: (North Sea flood) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Sea_flood_of_1953]  causes over 1,800 deaths in the Netherlands and over 300 in the United Kingdom.

[LINK: (1957) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1957]  – Eight people (five total crew from two aircraft and three on the ground) in  [LINK: (Pacoima, California) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacoima,_Los_Angeles]  are killed following the  [LINK: (mid-air collision) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacoima_aircraft_accident]  between a  [LINK: (Douglas DC-7) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douglas_DC-7]  airliner and a  [LINK: (Northrop F-89 Scorpion) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northrop_F-89_Scorpion]  fighter jet.

[LINK: (1958) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1958]  – Cold War:  [LINK: (Space Race) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_Race] : The  [LINK: (Explorer 1) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Explorer_1] , the first successful American satellite, detects the  [LINK: (Van Allen radiation belt) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Van_Allen_radiation_belt] .

[LINK: (1961) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1961]  –  [LINK: (Project Mercury) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Project_Mercury] :  [LINK: (Mercury-Redstone 2) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury-Redstone_2] : The chimpanzee  [LINK: (Ham) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ham_(chimpanzee)]  travels into  [LINK: (outer space) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_science] .

